# Skill

## Summary
A named skill with a `category` (`SkillCategoryField`: the vocabulary and colour map are exported as `SKILL_CATEGORIES` / `SKILL_CATEGORY_COLORS`). Candidates and Positions link skills so matching is by card, not by string.

## Usage
```ts
import { Skill } from '@cardstack/catalog/cards/hr/skill';

@field skills = linksToMany(Skill);
```

## Non-goals
No proficiency level — that belongs on the link's owner (a candidate's years with a skill), not on the shared skill card.
